height:1.8em; text-align:right;\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Association &laquo;PSYCHEIA&raquo;,</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:1.8em; text-align:right;\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Le D&eacute;partement de th&eacute;orie et de m&eacute;thodologie de la </span><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">psychologie pratique, Universit&eacute; d&#39;&Eacute;tat </span><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Ushinsk</span><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">y</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:1.8em; text-align:right;\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Association &laquo;Kharkiv Foundation for Psychological Research&raquo;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:1.8em; text-align:right;\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Le Centre Frantz Fanon, Montpellier</span></p>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-lnti901r":{"uri":"946bd9_dabf26184c0b4d3da45d4f218267ba0e~mv2.png","width":378,"height":370,"containerId":"comp-lnti901r","hasBgScrollEffect":"","bgEffectName":"","displayMode":"fill","link":{},"hasAnimation":false,"encoding":"AVIF","responsiveImageProps":{"fallbackSrc":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/946bd9_dabf26184c0b4d3da45d4f218267ba0e~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_154,h_151,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/946bd9_dabf26184c0b4d3da45d4f218267ba0e~mv2.png","srcset":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/946bd9_dabf26184c0b4d3da45d4f218267ba0e~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_154,h_151,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/946bd9_dabf26184c0b4d3da45d4f218267ba0e~mv2.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/946bd9_dabf26184c0b4d3da45d4f218267ba0e~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_308,h_302,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/946bd9_dabf26184c0b4d3da45d4f218267ba0e~mv2.png 2x","css":{"container":{"position":"relative"},"img":{"width":154,"height":151,"objectFit":"cover"}}},"containerWidth":154,"containerHeight":151,"isInFirstFold":true,"crop":null,"onClickBehavior":"goToLink","fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WPhoto","language":"fr","compId":"comp-lnti901r","mainPageId":"dt6xi","trackClicksAnalytics":false,"title":"teplo-logo-transparent.png","popupA11yExperimentEnabled":false,"translations":{"expandAriaLabel":"Agrandir l'image","zoomInButtonAriaLabel":"Zoom in"},"zoomedImageResponsiveOverride":{},"allowFullGIFTransformation":false},"comp-ln6pzuhv":{"html":"<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px; text-align:right;\"><span class=\"inherit-font-size wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px; text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Les statistiques internationales montrent que 30% de la population ayant v&eacute;cu des &eacute;v&eacute;nements traumatiques d&eacute;veloppent des troubles de stress post-traumatique. Une grande partie de la population rencontre des difficult&eacute;s d&#39;adaptation sociale et psychologique. Les r&eacute;fugi&eacute;s qui ont &eacute;t&eacute; traumatis&eacute;s souffrent de troubles mentaux et ne sont pas toujours pr&ecirc;ts &agrave; s&#39;adapter &agrave; leur nouvelle situation. Selon l&#39;Office fran&ccedil;ais de l&#39;immigration et de l&#39;int&eacute;gration, plus de 70 000 r&eacute;fugi&eacute;s d&#39;Ukraine sont arriv&eacute;s en France depuis l&#39;invasion russe de l&#39;Ukraine. En raison de l&#39;augmentation du nombre de r&eacute;fugi&eacute;s, il est urgent de cr&eacute;er un syst&egrave;me efficace de coop&eacute;ration entre les organisations publiques et &eacute;tatiques, les b&eacute;n&eacute;voles et les experts d&#39;Ukraine et de France.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px; text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Nous invitons des psychologues, des &eacute;ducateurs, des travailleurs sociaux, des b&eacute;n&eacute;voles d&#39;organisations publiques &agrave; participer &agrave; la conf&eacute;rence et &agrave; aborder des questions d&#39;actualit&eacute;.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Ouverture du forum :</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">discours de bienvenue des organisateurs et pr&eacute;sentation des r&eacute;sultats de la &quot;R&eacute;sidence artistique&quot; de deux jours pour les familles de r&eacute;fugi&eacute;s.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Pr&eacute;sentations :</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&laquo;L&#39;accompagnement psychologique des personnes fuyant l&#39;Ukraine sur le Centre Frantz<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nFanon&raquo;. </span></span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Muriel Montagut</span></span>, responsable du Centre Frantz Fanon, Montpellier (France)</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&laquo;Le protocole d&#39;intervention pour les psychologues et les travailleurs sociaux travaillant<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\navec les r&eacute;fugi&eacute;s dans le contexte des guerres au Moyen-Orient&raquo;. </span></span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Kari</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">m Dakroub</span></span>, Liban, psychologue clinicien, psychoth&eacute;rapeute, consultant et formateur en IPT et en support psychosocial, art th&eacute;rapeute.</span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&laquo;Exp&eacute;rience dans l&rsquo;organisation du soutien socio psychologique et de la r&eacute;habilitation<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\ndes familles d&eacute;plac&eacute;es&raquo;. </span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px;\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Kateryna Rebrova</span></span>, Ukraine, th&eacute;rapeute en traumatologie (EMDR, Autriche), art-th&eacute;rapeute, responsable de la filiale d&rsquo;Odessa de l&rsquo;Association d&rsquo;art-th&eacute;rapie.</span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&laquo;Expression et ext&eacute;riorisation des souffrances psychiques chez les sujets r&eacute;fugi&eacute;s par la<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nm&eacute;thode Photolangage : Un outil clinique &agrave; la carte &raquo;.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px;\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Dr Ali Hamaidia </span></span>(Alg&eacute;rie), Psychologue, Ma&icirc;tre de conf&eacute;rences en psychologie clinique, Chercheur, Unit&eacute; de Recherche &lsquo;D&eacute;veloppement des Ressources Humaines&rsquo; URDRH / Centre d&rsquo;Aide Psychologique &agrave;<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nl&rsquo;Universit&eacute; CAPU &ndash; Universit&eacute; de S&eacute;tif 2</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px;\"><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&laquo;Recherche sur les particularit&eacute;s de l&rsquo;&eacute;tat psychosomatique des femmes enceintes et<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nles attitudes envers le processus de la grossesse chez les r&eacute;fugi&eacute;s&raquo;. </span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px;\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Gertrude Szpatakowska</span></span>, Ukraine, RhD, pr&eacute;sidente de l&rsquo;Association &laquo;Psych&eacute;&raquo;, directrice de l&rsquo;Institut depsychologie p&eacute;rinatale et de psychosomatique (MIPS), syst&egrave;mes familiaux (Samadeva,<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nFrance), th&eacute;rapeute du traumatisme (EMDR, Autriche), psychoth&eacute;rapeute, art-th&eacute;rapeute,<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nmembre de l&rsquo;ASP, de l&rsquo;UASR, de l&rsquo;OASU.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px;\"><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&laquo;La m&eacute;thode Hibuki-th&eacute;rapie et son utilisation dans la th&eacute;rapie des traumatismes chez<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nles enfants et les adolescents&raquo;. </span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Dafna Sharon-Maksimov</span>, </span></span><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Isra&euml;l, responsable du projet Hibuki-open arms, experte internationale sur le travail avec les crises et les traumatismes chez les enfants et les adolescents.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px;\"><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&laquo;Application des protocoles EMDR de groupe dans le travail avec les enfants, les<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nadultes, les commotionn&eacute;s, apr&egrave;s un traumatisme&raquo;. </span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Kateryna Rebrova</span>, </span></span><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Ukraine, psychologue, th&eacute;rapeute EMDR, art-th&eacute;rapeute, praticien en travail corporel ; th&eacute;rapeute en traumatologie (EMDR, Autriche) ; psychologue, th&eacute;rapeute EMDR, superviseur Yulia Midko (EMDR, Autriche).</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px;\"><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&laquo;Approche art-th&eacute;rapeutique pour surmonter les traumatismes collectifs&raquo;. </span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Kateryna Koval</span>, </span></span><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Ukraine, ma&icirc;tre de conf&eacute;rences au d&eacute;partement de th&eacute;orie et de m&eacute;thodologie de la<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\npsychologie pratique du PNPU K.D. Ushinsky.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px;\"><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&laquo;Programme d&#39;art-th&eacute;rapie pour les familles qui ont v&eacute;cu des &eacute;v&eacute;nements de crise<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\ncomme syst&egrave;me de soutien et de r&eacute;habilitation&raquo; </span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Lyudmila Halytsyna</span>, </span></span><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Ukraine, psychologue dipl&ocirc;m&eacute;e en &eacute;ducation, membre du conseil d&#39;administration de l&#39;Association d&#39;art-th&eacute;rapie.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Approche art-th&eacute;rapeutique pour surmonter les traumatismes collectifs.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Koval Katerina</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Rapport FANON en cours</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px;\">&nbs